COMMENT ON VIEW public.feature_edge_by_regime IS 'Cross-sectional edge, pooled across symbols, per (feature, tf, regime, lookahead_bars). Exact population services/ic_engine.py''s promotion/demotion lifecycle hook reads. Current edge: filter training_window_end = max(training_window_end). History/trend: omit that filter. Todo 251, migration 297.';


